SUMMARY:Model Mondays - Claude Models in Microsoft Foundry: Tool Integrati
 ons in Practic
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nA single well-crafted prompt only g
 ets an agent so far. This session shows how to take agents further with to
 ol integrations available for Claude in Microsoft Foundry hosted on Azure.
 \n\nWe'll build workflows from scratch\, covering the setup choices that m
 atter most and how to get them right from the start\n\n* [Explore the Reso
 urces](https://github.com/microsoft/model-mondays)\n* [Read the Newsletter
 ](https://aka.ms/model-mondays/newsletter)\n* [Continue the conversation o
 n the Discord](https://aka.ms/model-mondays/discord)\n\n[eventID:27542]
