SUMMARY:Finalists Revealed: What a Winning Power BI Dataviz Looks Like
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nThese are the names to remember.\n\
 nMariia Drobina. Marius Helle. Aanor Le Gouic. Jeromeian Arbonida. They ar
 e all headed to the finals.\n\nMeet the Power BI Dataviz competition final
 ists and take a closer look at the work that earned them a spot on the glo
 bal stage.\n\nYou’ll see how they approached the challenge\, what made t
 heir visuals stand out\, and how they turned ideas into something that ris
 es above the rest. They’re headed to Barcelona to compete live on stage 
 at FabCon.\n\nThey’ll have 20 minutes (that’s 1\,200 seconds) to creat
 e a world-class visual in front of a cheering audience. When it’s over\,
  only one person can call themselves the Power BI Dataviz World Champion.\
 n\nPick your favorite and join their virtual cheer squad before they hit t
 he stage.
