SUMMARY:dbt job in Fabric: GA ready
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nThe session will focus on the Gener
 al Availability of dbt Job in Microsoft Fabric and will cover:\n\nWhat's n
 ew in dbt Job\, including key capabilities and enhancements available as p
 art of the GA release.\n\nA look at the product roadmap and future investm
 ents to help customers understand what's coming next.\n\nCustomer success 
 stories and lessons learned from organizations running dbt Job in producti
 on on Fabric today.
