SUMMARY:Run and Scale AI Applications with Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nKick off the series by building you
 r first cloud-native application using Azure Container Apps (ACA)\, the si
 mplest way to run containerized apps without managing infrastructure.\n\nI
 n this session\, you’ll learn how to: - Deploy and run apps quickly usin
 g a serverless container model - Build event-driven\, microservices-based 
 applications - Integrate AI and external services into your app - Scale au
 tomatically based on demand.
