SUMMARY:Production Ready: Observability\, Governance and Deployment
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nThe last episode covers what you ne
 ed before any of this runs somewhere real. OpenTelemetry traces and logs s
 how exactly what the agent did on each turn. Purview handles governance an
 d data protection. Evaluation gives us a way to tell whether quality holds
  as the SDK keeps moving.\n\nThen we deploy to Foundry Hosted Agents so th
 e thing runs as a service instead of a console app. We close by walking th
 rough the full refresh-prompt workflow as a maintenance pattern worth stea
 ling.
